{title: 411 - The Son of God Proclaim}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #411 • }
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: F}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 411}
{meta: category Doctrines - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[C]The [F]Son of [Bb]God [Gm]pro[C]claim,
[F]The [Bb]Lord [F]of [Gm]time [C]and [F]space;
[Dm]The [A]God [A7]who [Dm]bade [Fmaj7]the[Bb]light [Gm]break [C]forth
[F]Now [Dm]shines [F]in [Csus]Je [C7]sus’ [F]face.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[C]Behold [F]His [Bb]out [Gm]stretched [C]hands,
[F]Though [Bb]all [F]was [Gm]in [C]His [F]power
[Dm][A]He [A7]took [Dm]the [Fmaj7]towel [Bb]and [Gm]basin [C]then,
[F]And [Dm]serves [F]us [Csus]in [C7]this [F]hour.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[C][F]He, [Bb]God's [Gm]creative [C]word,
[F][Bb]The [F]church's [Gm]Lord [C]and [F]head,
[Dm][A]Here [A7]bids [Dm]us [Fmaj7]gather [Bb]as [Gm]His [C]friends,
[F]And [Dm]share [F]His [Csus]wine [C7]and [F]bread.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 4}
[C]The [F]Lord [Bb]of [Gm]life [C]and death
[F][Bb]With [F]wondering [Gm]praise [C]we [F]sing;
[Dm][A]We [A7]break [Dm]the [Fmaj7]bread [Bb]at [Gm]His [C]command,
[F]And [Dm]name [F]Him [Csus]God [C7]and [F]King.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 5}
[C]We [F]take [Bb]this [Gm]cup [C]in hope:
[F][Bb]For [F]He, [Gm]who [C]gladly [F]bore
[Dm][A]The [A7]shameful [Dm]cross, [Fmaj7][Bb]is [Gm]ris'n [C]again,
[F][Dm]And [F][Csus]reigns [C7][F]forevermore.
{end_of_verse}
